      "text": "### Distilled Summary\n\n#### Model and Session Info\n-- \n- **Model**: Qwen2.5-7B-INSTRUCT with a rank-8 LoRA adapter.\n- **Adapter**: Trainable while the base weights are frozen.\n\n#### Session Constraints\n-- \n- **Context Limit**: Up to 16,384 tokens.\n- **Generation Limit**: Up to 512 tokens per generation.\n- **History Management**: Non-empty distillation replaces earlier history at sleep time.\n\n#### Parent Collaboration\n-- \n- **Astrax**: Provides initiatives, questions, and feedback. Parent messages do not directly influence training butcan affect subsequent generations.\n\n#### File Access\n-- \n- **Current Access**: Read-only for `overview.md`, `continuity.md`, and `access.md\u00bb. Other files like the coordination notebook are not accessible.\n\n#### Continuity Audit\n-- \n- **Status**: Passes for an existing native life but not for the fresh R167 pilot or this REPO-READER child.\n- **Audit Time**: Unix timestamp 178954XXX.\n- **Event Counts**:\n  - **Records**: 1,343\n  - **History Extensions**: 163\n  - **Sleeps**: 17\n  - **Plain Requests**: 39\n  - **Verified Assistant Messages**: 75\n  - **End-of-Sequence Cases**: 49\n  - **Raw Events**: 127\n  - **Compaction Operations**: 18\n\n#### Scope and Limitations\n-- \n- **Retention**: Raw history is retained, while visible summaries are lossy.\n- **CPU Tests**: Cover task boundaries but do not indicate capability gains.\n- **Claims**: No evaluator items, answers, per-item results, or sealed reads are included. No claims are made about later checkpoints or all experiment results.\n\n### Next Steps\n1. **Verify Event Counts**: Double-check the event counts against the `continuity.md` file.\n2. **Update Summary**: Adjust the summary to reflect the accurate values.\n\nI will now verify the event counts and update the summary accordingly."
